117
00:04:28,647 --> 00:04:30,314
The pole star just sits there,

118
00:04:30,314 --> 00:04:32,581
telling you how far north you are,

119
00:04:32,581 --> 00:04:34,308
and never asks for a share.

120
00:04:34,308 --> 00:04:35,603
The captain asks you

121
00:04:35,603 --> 00:04:37,491
