122
00:04:37,491 --> 00:04:39,010
You give him a position.

123
00:04:39,010 --> 00:04:41,226
He nods as if he checked it.

124
00:04:41,226 --> 00:04:42,410
Then he tells the crew,

125
00:04:42,410 --> 00:04:45,427
who repeat it to each other with growing confidence,

126
00:04:45,427 --> 00:04:47,166
until by evening it has become a

127
00:04:47,166 --> 00:04:49,682
fact that you never actually claimed.

128
00:04:49,682 --> 00:04:51,238
We know what that work looked like,

129
00:04:51,238 --> 00:04:53,717
because Blackbeard's flagship carried the tools.

130
00:04:54,170 --> 00:04:55,339
In June seventeen eighteen,

131
00:04:55,339 --> 00:04:58,574
the Queen Anne's Revenge ran aground

132
00:04:58,574 --> 00:05:00,242
at Beaufort Inlet, North Carolina.

133
00:05:00,727 --> 00:05:02,218
Archaeologists later

134
00:05:02,218 --> 00:05:04,206
