146
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:33,234
Several leads have a hollow in the base,

147
00:05:33,234 --> 00:05:33,951
filled with

148
00:05:33,951 --> 00:05:36,651
something sticky such as tallow or wax.

149
00:05:36,651 --> 00:05:38,652
When the lead hit bottom,

150
00:05:38,652 --> 00:05:41,609
a sample of the seabed came back up with it.

151
00:05:41,609 --> 00:05:43,166
That is how you find your

152
00:05:43,166 --> 00:05:44,969
