166
00:06:15,348 --> 00:06:18,376
Even the lookout's eyes could fail.

167
00:06:18,376 --> 00:06:19,897
In February seventeen twenty-two,

168
00:06:19,897 --> 00:06:22,270
as our quartermaster episode told,

